        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Swat Valley, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan, Utror Valley, Kalam, Masurian Lake District, Warmian-Masurian Voivodeship, Poland\n- Products: Kundol Lake, Kundol Dand, Śniardwy, Pari Lake\n\nFacts:\n- Kundol Lake, also known as Kundol Dand, is a lake in Swat Valley, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan.\n- Kundol Lake is located north of Utror Valley and 19 km from Kalam.\n- Śniardwy is a lake in the Masurian Lake District of the Warmian-Masurian Voivodeship, Poland.\n- The western face of Pari Lake is open.\n- Water from Pari Lake flows down to Kundol Lake, which is situated in the foothills.",
